OL,3,GNEWSATop rating for care home where
OL,4,Awishes come true
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Shropshire care home where staff
OL,7,Fcarry out "small but meaningful acts of
OL,8,Fkindness" every day has been given a
OL,9,Ftop industry rating.
OL,11,FField House in Church Stretton, which
OL,12,Fwas judged outstanding by Care Quality
OL,13,FCommission (CQC) inspectors, is run by
OL,14,FScarborough Hall Limited and Barchester
OL,15,FHealthcare and supports older adults.
OL,17,FCare home manager Stephanie Morris said
OL,18,Fthe team was "over the moon" after
OL,19,Fimproving on its previous rating of
OL,20,Fgood.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
